      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in bringing to the market this exquisite 2 bed/2 bath apartment ideally positioned within The Academy Building in the highly sought-after Park West Pointe development.\nOne of the standout features of this impressive unit is its wonderfully private, leafy outlook. Unlike many apartments within the development which overlook courtyards or neighbouring buildings, this property enjoys a peaceful outlook over mature greenery and trees, with views stretching towards the Dublin Mountains resulting in a rare sense of privacy, serenity and tranquillity that is sure to impress.\nThe spacious accommodation is beautifully proportioned and offers an excellent balance of living and bedroom space. The property comprises an entrance hallway, generous open-plan living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two spacious double bedrooms, family bathroom and master ensuite. Large windows allow the greenery outside to become a feature of the living space, while excellent natural light and ample storage further complement the accommodation.\nThe well-established Park West Pointe development offers residents beautifully maintained communal grounds and an excellent range of transport links. The property is conveniently located close to the N4, M50 and Liffey Valley, while Dublin City Centre is readily accessible by car, bus and rail. Park West train station is within easy reach, providing a convenient commuter service into the city centre.\nAdditional Features:\n• BER B\n• c. 65 sq.m\n• 2 bed / 2 bath\n• 2nd floor apartment\n• Management fee c. 2,385 per annum\n• Private, peaceful and leafy outlook\n• Views towards the Dublin Mountains\n• Excellent sense of privacy and tranquillity\n• Generous and well-proportioned accommodation\n• Excellent natural light\n• Ample storage\n• Well-maintained communal grounds\n• Excellent transport links\n• Close to M50, N4 and Park West train station\n• Ideal for first-time buyers and investors\nEarly viewing is highly advised to appreciate the exceptional outlook, peaceful setting and overall appeal of this superb apartment. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\nDirections\nFrom the M50, take the N4 towards Dublin and exit at Park West. Continue towards Park West Business Campus and follow the signs for Park West Pointe. The Academy Building is located within the development.\n"
      },
      {
